sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client
    participant API as ComplianceReporting-Product<br/>ms-rc-crpt-compliance_reporting_retrieve-product
    participant Param as Lib Regionalizacion <br/> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.2-SNAPSHOT
    participant Lib as Librería Pipeline (ConfigMap)
    participant Wrapper as WrapperPreCredit DB<br/>ms-ic-comp-precredit-db-wrapper
    participant wrapperAbanks as Wrapper Abanks Multiconexión <br/> HU 16254
    participant Errors as Lib Errores <br/> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.2-SNAPSHOT

    Client->>API: POST /regulationscompliance/compliance-reporting/v1/retrieve-customer-check
    Note right of Client: Headers Authorization, Source-Bank, Destination-Bank,<br/>Application-Id, Caller-Service, Channel, Transaction-Date<br/>Body data.customerLegalReference (req),<br/>data.regulatoryListType (opcional, requerido funcional para GT01)

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        Note over API, Client: Validacion Campos Obligatorios
        API->>API: ValidacionEsquema OpenAPI
        API->>API: Validar Headers obligatorios <br/> Authorization, Source-Bank, Destination-Bank,<br/> Application-Id, Caller-Service
        API->>API: Validar Body obligatorios <br/> data.customerLegalReference
        alt Errores de validacion
            API-->>Client: Error 400
        end
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        Note over Client, Param: Proceso Validacion Regional
        API->>API: Cache Local <br/> key retrieve-customer-check
        alt Cache Config Not Found
            API->>Param: Solicitud Validacion
            Note over API: Regiones Disponibles de Dynamo <br/> NI01-NI01, GT01-GT01
            Param-->>API: Respuesta Validacion
            API->>API: Almacenar Config (TTL 24h)
            alt Param Service Unavailable
                API-->>Client: Error 502 (PARAMETER_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE)
            end
        end
        alt Region no encontrada o enabled false
            API-->>Client: Error 422 (REGION_NOT_CONFIGURED / REGION_NOT_ENABLED)
        end
    end

    Note over API: Uso del Patron Strategy
    Note over API: Configuracion multidestino del Wrapper PreCredit<br/>HU 61619 debe registrar 2 items en DynamoDB del wrapper<br/>NI COUNTRY#NIC#DOMAIN#WRAPPER_PRECREDIT_DB#PARAM#compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-ni<br/>GT COUNTRY#GTM#DOMAIN#WRAPPER_PRECREDIT_DB#PARAM#compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-gt<br/>cada uno con su pareja param-name y secret-name por region
    API->>API: Selecciona Estrategia por Source-Bank

    alt Source-Bank = NI01
        Note over API: Estrategia Nicaragua regulatoryListType se ignora,<br/>backend retorna todas las listas<br/>Conectividad delegada al Wrapper PreCredit DB
        API->>API: Preparar Payload <br/> operationType=query, catalogueName=CREDITOS_RIESGOS,<br/>procedureName=NI_ONBASE.CONSULTA_LISTA_CLIENTE,<br/>params.IDENTIDAD=customerLegalReference
        API->>Wrapper: POST /wrapper-precredit-db/v1/execute-procedure
        Note over API,Wrapper: Header sourceBank=NI01<br/>Header caller-service=compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-ni
        Note over Wrapper: HU 61642 - resuelve PS/SM via item Dynamo<br/>COUNTRY#NIC#DOMAIN#WRAPPER_PRECREDIT_DB#PARAM#compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-ni
        Wrapper-->>API: Evaluar Payload <br/> success, data.outputParameters, data.resultSets<br/>(LISTAS multiples segun SP NI_ONBASE.CONSULTA_LISTA_CLIENTE)
        API->>API: Mapear salida NI a regulatoryMatchList (cardinalidad N)
        API-->>Client: 200 OK
        Note over Client, API: data.customerReference, data.customerName,<br/>data.regulatoryMatchList.regulatoryListDetail

    else Source-Bank = GT01
        Note over API: Estrategia Guatemala regulatoryListType funcionalmente requerido<br/>Conectividad delegada al Wrapper PreCredit DB
        alt regulatoryListType no informado
            API-->>Client: Error 422 (REGULATORY_LIST_TYPE_REQUIRED)
        else regulatoryListType informado
            API->>API: Resolver SP por regulatoryListType<br/>CRIME spr_validaListaNegraDelitos_v2,<br/>IVE spr_validaListaNegraIVE_v2,<br/>OFAC_ONU spr_validaListaNegraOfacOnu_v2,<br/>PEP spr_validaListaNegraPEP_v2,<br/>RCJ spr_validaListaNegraRCJ_v2,<br/>RSR spr_validaListaNegraRSR_v2
            API->>API: Preparar Payload <br/> operationType=query, catalogueName=dbo,<br/>procedureName=resuelto, params.LEGAL_ID=customerLegalReference
            API->>Wrapper: POST /wrapper-precredit-db/v1/execute-procedure
            Note over API,Wrapper: Header sourceBank=GT01<br/>Header caller-service=compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-gt
            Note over Wrapper: HU 61642 - resuelve PS/SM via item Dynamo<br/>COUNTRY#GTM#DOMAIN#WRAPPER_PRECREDIT_DB#PARAM#compliance-reporting-retrieve-customer-check-gt
            Wrapper-->>API: Evaluar Payload <br/> success, data.outputParameters, data.resultSets<br/>(1 elemento)
            API->>API: Mapear salida GT a regulatoryMatchList (cardinalidad 1)
            Note over API: Regla OFAC_ONU GT01 si LISTANEGRA es NULL,<br/>tratar como NO RECORDS
            API-->>Client: 200 OK
            Note over Client, API: data.customerReference, data.customerName,<br/>data.regulatoryMatchList.regulatoryListDetail
        end

    else Source-Bank = PA01
        Note over API: Estrategia Panamá regulatoryListType se ignora,<br/>backend retorna todas las listas<br/>Conectividad delegada al Wrapper Abanks Multiconexión

        API->>Lib: Consulta Constantes
    
        Lib->>API: Retorna constantes necesarias
        Note left of Lib: Constantes: <br> caller-service <br> schemaPA <br> packagePA <br> procedureNamePA
        
        API->>API: Preparar Payload 
        Note over API: paramName = libParam.param-name <br> secretName = libParam.secret-name <br> operationType = const.query, catalogueName = const.schemaPA,<br/>procedureName = const.procedureNamePA,<br/>params.IDENTIDAD = customerLegalReference
        
        API->>wrapperAbanks: POST /wrapper-precredit-db/v1/execute-procedure
        Note right of API: Header sourceBank=NI01<br/>Header caller-service=const.caller-service <br> paramName, <br> secretName <br> operationType, <br> catalogueName, <br> procedureName <br> params

        wrapperAbanks->>API: Evaluar Response Wrapper
        Note left of wrapperAbanks: success, data.outputParameters, <br> data.outputParameters.Pv_Identificacion,<br> data.outputParameters.Pv_Nombre, <br>  data.outputParameters.Pv_Lista_Peps, <br>  data.outputParameters.Pv_Lista_Excepciones, <br> data.outputParameters.Pv_Otros, <br> data.outputParameters.Pv_Message, <br>  data.outputParameters.Pv_SuccessIndicator
        
        API->>API: Consstruir Response API
        Note over API: customerReference = data.outputParameters.Pv_Identificacion <br/> customerName = data.outputParameters.Pv_Nombre <br> regulatoryMatchList.regulatoryListDetail {<br> regulatoryListName = "Lista Peps", customerComplianceStatus = data.outputParameters.Pv_Lista_Peps <br> regulatoryListName = "Lista Excepciones", customerComplianceStatus = data.outputParameters.Pv_Lista_Excepciones <br> regulatoryListName = "Otros", customerComplianceStatus = data.outputParameters.Pv_Otros <br> }
        
        API-->>Client: 200 OK
        Note over Client, API: Respuesta Exitosa
    
    end

    activate API
        alt Exception occurs
            note over Errors: Error Library Handler
            activate Errors
                API->>Errors: BusinessCoreException(apiMethod, applicationBackend, errorMessage, errorCode)
                Errors-->>API: Retorna httpCode, businessErrorCode, shortDesc, longDesc
            deactivate Errors
            activate Client
                API-->>Client: Retorna error
            deactivate Client
        end
    deactivate API
    Note over Client,Errors: Diagrama guia de manejo de errores <br> http://bit.ly/4rpKVIU